`benchmark.meta description: Repeats matrix translation, scaling, composition and point transforms.
`benchmark.meta timing: recommended
`benchmark.meta profiles: graphics,compile-timing

/graphics/matrix
/graphics/point
/graphics/primitives

. base = Matrix(2, 3, 5, 7, 11, 13)
. checksum = 0.0
for index in 0 .. < 5000000
    . point = Point((index % 97) as F64, (index % 61) as F64)
    . shifted = base.translate(point)
    . scaled = shifted.scale(Dimensions(2, 3))
    . composed = scaled.concatenate(base)
    . transformed = composed.transform(point)
    checksum += transformed.x + transformed.y

-- "bench-result graphics/matrix-operations-hot checksum=${checksum as Size}"
